The day off will be taken the day after the team's homecoming.
There will also be celebrations for the hero team in their home country.
Fiji's rugby team celebrated the championship.
According to The Guardian, the country watched the finals in the capital Suva, where a screen had been erected in the stadium.
Normally, only native Fijians are interested in rugby, but this game united our multicultural community.
Even in Chinese restaurants watched the game, I heard them cheer," Maikele Seru, a reporter for the Fiji Times, told the Guardian.
Drama in Rio - the Finnish buyer fainted after a wild performance
