We are looking for a top player for our team that has power and whose threshold to come to Finland and Rovaniemi is small.
Together with more than ten player agents, we went through more than 50 players from all over the world.
Little by little, Prosa began to stand out from the crowd as a good alternative, RoPS coach Juha Malinen said in a press release.
